# Job Card Standard

## Structure
- `JOB_CARDS/{slug}/CARD.md` — identity, mission, RACI, KPI, heading index
- `JOB_CARDS/{slug}/H###.md` — description + guidance + training (200+ chars each when expanded)
- `HEADINGS_INDEX.md` — tracks H001..H200 status

## QA thresholds (scaffold phase)
- CARD.md ≥ 500 chars (scaffold); target 2000+ via `/devam`
- Each H*.md ≥ 200 chars when marked `expanded`
- QA hook warns; does not block scaffold

## Critic loop
generate → critique → revise (max 3) → escalate to human
